    <kbd>Space</kbd> play · <kbd>B</kbd> blink · <kbd>←</kbd><kbd>→</kbd> scrub · <kbd>1</kbd>–<kbd>6</kbd> band · <kbd>[</kbd> <kbd>]</kbd> speed · <kbd>P</kbd> present · <kbd>S</kbd> snapshot<br>
    Real SPHEREx data: <span style="color:var(--accent);">spherex.caltech.edu</span> · archive: <span style="color:var(--accent);">irsa.ipac.caltech.edu</span>
